    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:ec46e3209ab74818",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "67d3ea59771d05c1ce76515b8329cf36f7e1c9ecdec7a5f550de4c75db9748cc",
      "text": "Breakfast at Hote. Tour to the Orient: Piedra del Peñol and Reservoirs Area. The new town of El Peñol is a fundamental starting point to get to know the past of this area. The visit will continue to the majestic Piedra del Peñol, which is one of the most interesting natural attractions of Colombia. Later we will visit the town of Guatape, famous for the details of the basement of the houses where we will take a tour by motorcycle taxi. Afterward, we will visit the Peñol- Guatape reservoir, by boat (additional cost). There we can enjoy a unique landscape. (Lunch is not included)\n\nDuration: 8 Hours - Days of Operation: Every day\n\nIncludes: Tour as described, motorcycle taxi tour, bilingual guide, transportation and, local Medical Assistance Card.",
